> Campaign details CRUD

Base URL: http://localhost:8080/api/campaigns

    Create Campaign for a Client
        Endpoint: POST /client/{clientId}
        URL Params:
        clientId → ID of the client
            {
              "campaignName": "Black Friday Sale",
              "goal": "Increase sales by 30%",
              "description": "Campaign for holiday season",
              "amount": 5000,
              "startDate": "2025-11-10",
              "endDate": "2025-11-30"
            }

    Get Campaigns by Client
        Endpoint: GET /client/{clientId}
        URL Params:
        clientId → ID of the client
        Response (JSON Array):
            [
              {
                "id": 1,
                "campaignName": "Black Friday Sale",
                "goal": "Increase sales by 30%",
                "description": "Campaign for holiday season",
                "amount": 5000,
                "startDate": "2025-11-10",
                "endDate": "2025-11-30",
                "client": {
                  "id": 1,
                  "firstName": "Md Sajjad",
                  "lastName": "Hossain"
                }
              }
            ]

    Get Single Campaign
        Endpoint: GET /{id}
        URL Params:
        id → campaign ID
        Response (JSON):
            {
              "id": 1,
              "campaignName": "Black Friday Sale",
              "goal": "Increase sales by 30%",
              "description": "Campaign for holiday season",
              "amount": 5000,
              "startDate": "2025-11-10",
              "endDate": "2025-11-30",
              "client": {
                "id": 1,
                "firstName": "Md Sajjad",
                "lastName": "Hossain"
              }
            }

    Update Campaign
        Endpoint: PUT /{campaignId}
        URL Params:
        campaignId → campaign ID
        Request Body:
        JSON Example 1: Update campaign only (no client change)
            {
              "campaignName": "Black Friday Sale Updated",
              "goal": "Increase sales by 35%",
              "description": "Updated campaign description",
              "amount": 5500,
              "startDate": "2025-11-12",
              "endDate": "2025-11-30"
            }

        JSON Example 2: Update campaign and change client
            {
              "campaignName": "Black Friday Sale Updated",
              "goal": "Increase sales by 35%",
              "description": "Updated campaign description",
              "amount": 5500,
              "startDate": "2025-11-12",
              "endDate": "2025-11-30",
              "client": {
                "id": 3
              }
            }

    Delete Campaign
        Endpoint: DELETE /{id}
            URL Params:
            id → campaign ID
            Response: 204 No Content